# Documentation & status

When architecture, security, uplink, wiring, or ops behavior changes:

- Update `doc/guide/` / product notes and applicable `doc/status/` records.
- Record real build/test commands, env/board, risks, migrations.
- Distinguish verified vs planned. Never mark exceptions or phases complete without evidence.
